/-
# Places of the critical normal closure

Bundles the constructions inside the actual normal closure of the critical source field over the
observation field: a discrete valuation ring above the common-scale Laurent arc (by going up in the
integral closure), whose residue field has characteristic zero; integral lifts and reductions of all
geometric sheets at that place; extension of the source Schur valuation to the normal closure by
Krull domination; invariance of the normal-closure Galois group's cardinality under extension of
algebraically closed constants; and the normal form of a Hilbert-Burch Tor computation on
normal-crossing coordinate faces.
-/

